Geant4 10.6 on arm64 macOS with libc++:
1. thread_local with Clang on any macOS architecture, not only x86_64 (Apple silicon fell
   through to the branch for old GCC versions, whose __thread does not accept the dynamic
   initialisers Geant4 uses). Later Geant4 versions use thread_local throughout;
2. G4THitsMap.hh uses std::is_fundamental without including <type_traits>, which libstdc++
   gets from other headers and libc++ does not.

diff --git a/source/digits_hits/hits/include/G4THitsMap.hh b/source/digits_hits/hits/include/G4THitsMap.hh
index fe5e930..a89b0ed 100644
